		(property "BOM Comments" "IN and EN on 5V_SYS; ILIM through R618=49.9k 1% to GND. OUT feeds J601 sensor, J502 fan and U503 PWM buffer on EXT_VCC. 475-565mA limit over temperature at nominal resistor value, before 1% resistor tolerance. Target fan <=250mA running and combined accessory load <=300mA; verify fan startup and USB source budget. FAULT to PC13 via existing R604. A shared fault can remove external feedback: firmware must stop torque."
